# Dependencies are installed inside the image; host copies (often built for another OS) must not leak in
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets never enter the build context
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.keys
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Not needed to build the API
.git
.github
apps/web
apps/mobile
docs
**/*.log
